  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Peacebuilding in Sri Lanka</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Investment to support reconciliation and peacebuilding activities in Sri Lanka through working with local civil society organisations to strengthen capacity and facilitate advocacy and awareness-raising on human rights issues. It aims to empower and build resilience of civil society actors and vulnerable communities to foster peace and social cohesion in Sri Lanka.</narrative>
  </description>
